				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2020 19:07:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MrAnakinSpecter</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1477805</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Is this an intentional homage to <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-789-j">the butt ghost</a>? If it is, I can kind of admire the attempt to make a joke article into a serious one, but I don't think you handled the execution very well. To me, at least, reading this felt like I was not in on some sort of reference &#8212; I don't really understand why you chose to include some details. I mean, fine, it's kind of weird for someone to have six whole chickens in their refrigerator, but I don't see the significance of that as it relates to the narrative. I'm also not sure why the wife would drown herself. -1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
